[{"id":"D2-0001","d":2,"o":"2.4","x":"medium","q":"An organization is decommissioning self-encrypting SSDs that held confidential data. The drives will be resold to a third party. Which sanitization method is MOST appropriate?","c":["Cryptographic erase followed by verification","A single overwrite pass of the full drive","Degaussing each drive before release","Quick-formatting the drive's file system"],"k":""},{"id":"D2-0002","d":2,"o":"2.1","x":"easy","q":"A newly created financial forecast must be classified before it can be distributed. Who is PRIMARILY responsible for assigning its classification level?","c":["The data custodian","The security administrator","The data owner","The compliance officer"],"k":""},{"id":"D2-0003","d":2,"o":"2.5","x":"medium","q":"A company's retention schedule requires deleting customer records after seven years. Litigation is filed that involves records now due for deletion. What MUST the organization do?","c":["Suspend deletion of the affected records under a legal hold","Proceed with deletion as the retention schedule requires","Anonymize the records so deletion can proceed safely","Delete the records but retain their cryptographic hashes"],"k":""},{"id":"D2-0004","d":2,"o":"2.6","x":"medium","q":"An organization selects a control baseline for a new system, removes the controls that do not apply to its environment, and adjusts the parameters of the rest to fit its risk profile. What is this process called?","c":["Gap analysis","Scoping and tailoring","Control self-assessment","Certification and accreditation"],"k":""},{"id":"D2-0005","d":2,"o":"2.3","x":"easy","q":"Before assigning protection controls to its servers, laptops, and cloud instances, a security team wants confidence that nothing will be missed. Which activity MUST come first?","c":["Deploying endpoint detection on all known devices","Encrypting data at rest across the estate","Conducting a penetration test of the network","Building and maintaining a complete asset inventory"],"k":""}]
